Package: SDDGP
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Deconvolution via Deep Gaussian Processes
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xiao", "Yang", email = "njjyxl1006@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A two-stage Bayesian framework for spatial transcriptomics 
    deconvolution. Stage 1 combines a deep Gaussian process (DGP) spatial 
    prior with per-spot MCMC sampling under a negative binomial likelihood 
    to estimate cell-type proportions with full posterior uncertainty 
    (credible intervals, R-hat, ESS). Stage 2 refines spot-level estimates 
    to single-cell resolution via constrained non-negative least squares 
    guided by cosine similarity to a reference atlas. Additional modules 
    provide CARD-style resolution enhancement and comprehensive convergence 
    diagnostics.
